  "description": "Portfolio: My current holdings and allocation.",
  "body_html": "<p></p><p><a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/p/svif-usa-portfolio\">Portfolio</a>: My current holdings and allocation.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/p/watchlist\">Watchlist</a>: Stocks I’m tracking, including target prices.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/p/stock-picks-performance-paid\">Stock Picks Performance</a>: Performance of every stock I’ve recommended since launching <em>Beating the Tide.</em></p><p><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3704888\">Chat</a>: Chat dedicated to paid subscribers.  </p><p><strong>Want to see more tools added here? Tell me what you’d find most useful.</strong></p><div class=\"directMessage button\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;userId&quot;:84964221,&quot;userName&quot;:&quot;George Atuan, CFA&quot;,&quot;canDm&quot;:null,&quot;dmUpgradeOptions&quot;:null,&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"DirectMessageToDOM\"></div><div><hr></div><p><em>The <a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/p/weekly-stock-performance-tracker\">Weekly Stock Performance Tracker</a> has been retired starting with Weekly #91, as Substack enabled a feature to provide audience-specific content. But if you want to check the weekly stock performance pre-Weekly #91, you can find it <a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/p/weekly-stock-performance-tracker\">here.</a></em></p>",
